Leaf bundles a small metadata synonym dictionary
(crates/leaf-common/data/synonyms.yaml), selected from:

- Open English WordNet 2025, by the Open English WordNet team
  (https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet), licensed under the
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- Princeton WordNet, from which Open English WordNet is derived,
  under the WordNet License
  (https://wordnet.princeton.edu/license-and-commercial-use).
  WordNet 3.0 Copyright 2006 by Princeton University. All rights reserved.

Only the synonyms of the keywords listed in
crates/leaf-common/data/keywords.yaml are included.
